msgstr "Usa la sicurezza a livello di riga e colonna"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DataSegregationStrategyPicker.tsx
#: metabase/permissions_rest/api.clj
msgid "Connection impersonation"
msgstr "Impersonificazione della connessione"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DataSegregationStrategyPicker.tsx
msgid "All data is stored in the same database, but Metabase will use a different database role to connect for each tenant. Roles are configured at the database level to only query relevant data."
msgstr "Tutti i dati sono archiviati nello stesso database, ma Metabase userà un ruolo database diverso per connettersi per ciascun tenant. I ruoli sono configurati a livello di database per interrogare solo i dati pertinenti."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DataSegregationStrategyPicker.tsx
msgid "Use connection impersonation"
msgstr "Usa l’impersonificazione della connessione"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DataSegregationStrategyPicker.tsx
msgid "Each tenant has their own database with identical schema. Metabase will use a connection string from a tenant attribute to run queries against a different destination database."
msgstr "Ogni tenant ha il proprio database con schema identico. Metabase userà una stringa di connessione da un attributo del tenant per eseguire query su un database di destinazione diverso."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DataSegregationStrategyPicker.tsx
msgid "Use database routing"
msgstr "Usa l’instradamento del database"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DatabaseRoutingStepContent.tsx
msgid "Follow the steps in the documentation to manage data permissions with database routing."
msgstr "Segui i passaggi nella documentazione per gestire i permessi sui dati con l’instradamento del database."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DatabaseRoutingStepContent.tsx
msgid "Manage data permissions with database routing"
msgstr "Gestisci i permessi sui dati con l’instradamento del database"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DatabaseRoutingStepContent.tsx
msgid "Follow the guide in the docs to enable database routing at the data source level, add destination databases and configure the relevant tenant attributes."
msgstr "Segui la guida nella documentazione per abilitare l’instradamento del database a livello di fonte dati, aggiungere database di destinazione e configurare gli attributi tenant pertinenti."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/DatabaseRoutingStepContent.tsx
msgid "View the guide"
msgstr "Visualizza la guida"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/EnableTenantsStepContent.tsx
msgid "Shared collection"
msgstr "Raccolta condivisa"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/EnableTenantsStepContent.tsx
msgid "Failed to enable tenants and create shared collection"
msgstr "Impossibile abilitare i tenant e creare la raccolta condivisa"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/EnableTenantsStepContent.tsx
msgid "A tenant is a set of attributes assigned to a user to isolate them from other tenants. For example, in a SaaS app with embedded Metabase dashboards, you can assign each customer to a tenant."
msgstr "Un tenant è un insieme di attributi assegnati a un utente per isolarlo dagli altri tenant. Ad esempio, in un’app SaaS con dashboard Metabase incorporate, puoi assegnare ogni cliente a un tenant."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/EnableTenantsStepContent.tsx
msgid "The main benefit of tenants is that you can reuse the same dashboards and permissions across all tenants, instead of recreating them for each customer, while ensuring each tenant only sees its own data. A shared collection will be created to hold dashboards and charts that are shared between all tenants."
msgstr "Il principale vantaggio dei tenant è che puoi riutilizzare le stesse dashboard e gli stessi permessi su tutti i tenant, invece di ricrearli per ogni cliente, assicurando che ogni tenant veda solo i propri dati. Verrà creata una raccolta condivisa per contenere dashboard e grafici condivisi tra tutti i tenant."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/EnableTenantsStepContent.tsx
msgid "Enable tenants and create shared collection"
msgstr "Abilita i tenant e crea la raccolta condivisa"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupPermissionsAndTenantsPage/MoveDashboardStepContent.tsx
msgid "Failed to move dashboard to the shared collection"
msgstr "Impossibile spostare la dashboard nella raccolta condivisa"

